{
  "name": "@puraloka/mobile",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "main": "expo-router/entry",
  "_catatan_packageManager": [
    "EAS Build membaca package.json INI, bukan yang di akar.",
    "Diukur 2026-09-01 dari log build (fase READ_PACKAGE_JSON):",
    "ia mencetak `@puraloka/mobile`, lalu INSTALL_DEPENDENCIES",
    "gagal dengan ERR_PNPM_BROKEN_LOCKFILE — pnpm bawaan server",
    "menolak lockfile dua-dokumen yang ditulis pnpm 11.",
    "",
    "`packageManager` di package.json AKAR sudah ditambahkan lebih",
    "dulu dan TIDAK menolong, karena bukan itu yang dibaca EAS.",
    "",
    "Versinya WAJIB sama dengan akar (pnpm@11.8.0). Dua tempat",
    "berbeda versi berarti mesin pengembang dan server build",
    "memakai pnpm berbeda, dan bedanya baru terlihat saat build",
    "gagal — bukan saat menyunting."
  ],
  "packageManager": "pnpm@11.8.0",
  "scripts": {
    "eas-build-pre-install": "node ../../scripts/eas-lockfile-satu-dokumen.mjs",
    "start": "expo start",
    "android": "expo start --android",
    "ios": "expo start --ios",
    "web": "expo start --web"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@expo/vector-icons": "^14.0.2",
    "@react-native-async-storage/async-storage": "^2.1.2",
    "axios": "^1.7.9",
    "expo": "~53.0.27",
    "expo-camera": "~16.1.11",
    "expo-constants": "~17.1.8",
    "expo-device": "^7.1.4",
    "expo-file-system": "18.1.11",
    "expo-image-picker": "~16.1.4",
    "expo-linking": "~7.1.7",
    "expo-notifications": "^0.31.5",
    "expo-router": "~5.1.11",
    "expo-secure-store": "~14.2.4",
    "expo-splash-screen": "~0.30.10",
    "expo-status-bar": "~2.2.3",
    "react": "19.0.0",
    "react-native": "0.79.6",
    "react-native-safe-area-context": "5.4.0",
    "react-native-screens": "~4.11.1",
    "react-native-webview": "^13.13.5"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@babel/core": "^7.25.2",
    "@types/react": "~19.0.14",
    "typescript": "^5.8.3"
  }
}
